commit dfde6603472f6c44da4886325dee1510af6b2987
Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 28 15:08:00 2026 +1100

    dhcp: Return the result of _has_running_interfaces
    
    _has_running_interfaces always returned None since the 2023 change
    that added it, so the namespace is deleted on every segment disable
    of a multi-segment network while other segments' dnsmasq still run
    in it. Return the value, and test both branches.
    
    Assisted-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 (low effort)
    Change-Id: Ib9ecc14e83d609b5255a130954602563512f06a0
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

diff --git a/neutron/agent/linux/dhcp.py b/neutron/agent/linux/dhcp.py
